   "cause": "Test harness startup race, not an application or proxy configuration defect: docker run --detach returns before the nginx image entrypoint execs nginx, and until nginx listens the published port accepts and then drops connections",
   "reproduction": "Locally the unmodified script failed with the identical error when the locked image was given a 3 s /docker-entrypoint.d delay through NGINX_TEST_IMAGE, and passed with the locked image",
   "fix": "scripts/verify-nginx.mjs waits up to 30 s for /health/ready (outside the auth rate-limit zone, retrying network errors only) before the rate-limit batch; the upstream 204 log assertion is scoped to auth rows so the readiness probe cannot satisfy it",
   "fixVerification": "Fixed script passed with the delayed-start image and with the locked image (60 requests: 11 accepted and proxied upstream, 49 rate limited); with a never-ready image it failed after the 30 s bound and removed its container; eslint passed"
  }
